  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mrow/><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#931;</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mrow/><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mn>101</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>99</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
